bzip3-rs (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Recover mode for the bzip3 tool (-r, --recover).
  * BlockDecoder::recover_block_into and BlockStatus.
  * Debian and Ubuntu .deb packages for amd64 and arm64.
  * Faster decode on x86-64-v3 / native builds.

 -- Karol Harasim <karol.harasim@gmail.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

